{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787296878240392001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"unritual-futile-waterdogs","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"19715a7b7c6eb935d67214eb0bc5da67f8ca3e6406349e6488e5fb541f895b97","event_uuid":"28e504a8-9514-494a-9729-935072d72861","position":{"commit_sha":"7465afcd87a8a7d1c43c196eaffb4159b68144c8","position":"1787290318169210001-28e504a8-9514-494a-9729-935072d72861"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b68e46f0fe9d45f3b56f9ce09c3913bec5503adfd84fac80b1904faa595d6623","event_uuid":"f752164b-71ce-45d8-9be3-50af73796610","position":{"commit_sha":"8a76938295115eb16f44d4e30b4e21389fa462eb","position":"1787290428993518001-f752164b-71ce-45d8-9be3-50af73796610"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2f11ad9ea9227df4366d786909ab845c46c9ce010054fffa31c93ee420da3fc6","event_uuid":"83e8c7ca-d2ac-4f65-a6cd-be4d5cdf51fd","position":{"commit_sha":"62fe9264f94d6782fd36d49091b041389fcfa786","position":"1787290487411123001-83e8c7ca-d2ac-4f65-a6cd-be4d5cdf51fd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787290318169210001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"83e8c7ca-d2ac-4f65-a6cd-be4d5cdf51fd","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"bfe7-0900-c3d1-4141"}],"description":"# Config-driven link-relation mapping (skip-not-approximate preserved)\n\n## Context / Problem\n\nRelation→Jira-link mapping is hardcoded (`value_maps.RELATION_TO_JIRA_LINK`), and some\nrelations are deliberately unsynced (`value_maps.UNSYNCED_RELATIONS`) rather than\napproximated — the established \"skip, don't approximate\" philosophy. A Jira project whose\nconfigured link types differ (e.g. no `Supersedes`, but a `Problem/Incident` pair) has no\nconfig recourse: it can't remap a rebar relation onto the project's actual link type, nor\ndeclare a relation unsynced for that project. Link relations must become config-driven on\nthe S1 core while preserving skip-not-approximate: map to a real project link type, or\nskip — never invent an approximate link.\n\n## Approach\n\nWire the S1 `link_map` axis. Outbound: resolve the effective link map over the built-in\ndefault (`RELATION_TO_JIRA_LINK`); a relation mapped to a project link type uses it; a\nrelation mapped to the `skip` sentinel (or absent from the target's declared `link_types`)\nis not synced — extending, per-project, the `UNSYNCED_RELATIONS` behavior. Validation\n(S1) fails closed if a `link_map` value names a link type absent from the project's\ndeclared `link_types` vocabulary. No approximate/alternative link is ever substituted\n(that echo-unsafe path was rejected in design). Parent relationships are out of scope here\n— they are handled by S7 (drift + breadcrumb), not the link axis.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/value_maps.py` — built-in\n  default becomes injected fallback; resolution routed through S1.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py` — link emission consults the\n  resolved map / skip set.\n- `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_link_mapping.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\n\n- **Config-effect contrast (unit):** with `link_map.supersedes=\"Relates\"`, an outbound\n  supersedes relation emits a `Relates` link; default leaves it unsynced — same path,\n  different config.\n- **Skip preserved:** a relation mapped to `skip` (or absent from declared `link_types`)\n  emits no link — asserted on the emitted link set.\n- **Fail-closed:** a `link_map` value naming an undeclared link type raises the named\n  validation error at load.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Effective link map = built-in ← `default` ← `projects.<KEY>`; a non-default overlay\n  changes the emitted Jira link type through the real path — verified by\n  `test_link_mapping.py::test_link_config_effect`.\n- [ ] A `skip`-mapped or undeclared relation emits no link (skip-not-approximate) —\n  verified by `test_link_mapping.py::test_link_skip_preserved`.\n- [ ] A `link_map` value naming an undeclared link type fails closed at load — verified by\n  `test_link_mapping.py::test_link_undeclared_fails_closed`.\n\nTest tier: **in-process unit** — link resolution and the emit/skip decision are pure\nfunctions; the oracle is the emitted link set and the raised validation error.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/value_maps.py","reason":"link built-in default becomes injected fallback"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py","reason":"link emission consults resolved map/skip set"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_link_mapping.py","reason":"new link-mapping tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","bfe7-0900-c3d1-4141"],["parent","3d7a-7795-efde-4df7"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3d7a-7795-efde-4df7","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1515-bebc-0d91-476b","ticket_type":"story","title":"Config-driven link-relation mapping (skip-not-approximate preserved)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["28e504a8-9514-494a-9729-935072d72861","f752164b-71ce-45d8-9be3-50af73796610","83e8c7ca-d2ac-4f65-a6cd-be4d5cdf51fd"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787296878240392001,"uuid":"2eac3063-19cf-45b7-837e-bd69001b8255"}